===Tattoo Shenanigans===
Mods Jerv (Concept Artist) and Skylark (Character Artist) have been ink-spired by your [https://discord.com/channels/324132423636090880/1333487319218520127 #tattoo-suggestions] on Discord and have been hard at work sketching up some OSRS-themed masterpieces. What did they come up with? A majestic Saradomin eagle? A full-back tattoo of the Wise Old Man’s luscious beard? Tune in to find out!

And lastly, don’t forget to drop your nostalgic RuneScape memories in the [https://discord.com/channels/324132423636090880/1333485487817756786 #12-yrs-of-memories channel] on Discord! Whether it’s your first 99, that unforgettable PKing moment, or the time you spent three hours lost in the Brimhaven Dungeon (we’ve all been there), we’d love to see them!

It’s time to party like it’s 2013 - see you there!

